  <!-- ================= FEATURES & SERVICES ================= -->
  <section class="full-width-section" id="features">
    <div class="section-container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-badge">Everything Your Business Needs</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Engineered For Modern Retailers, D2C & Growing Businesses</h2>
        <p class="section-desc">Traditional generic CRMs and expensive SMS gateways fail to drive real repeat sales. EasyToReach is built from the ground up with interactive buttons, WhatsApp automation, and cashable loyalty points that customers actually love.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-cards-grid">
        <!-- 1. Birthday Automation -->
        <div class="feature-card reveal">
          <div class="feature-icon-bubble" style="background:var(--gold-light); color:#b45309;">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-cake-candles"></i>
          </div>
          <h3>Automated Birthday & Anniversary Gifting</h3>
          <p>Never miss a customer's special day. Our automated daily cron engine dispatches personalized greeting cards with a 7-day exclusive discount voucher directly to their WhatsApp.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Personalized customer name & discount %</li>
            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Strict anti-spam rule (1 wish per calendar year)</li>
            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Automated morning delivery at 9:00 AM</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- 2. Festive Broadcasts -->
        <div class="feature-card reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">
          <div class="feature-icon-bubble" style="background:var(--primary-100); color:var(--primary-600);">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-bullhorn"></i>
          </div>
          <h3>Festive & Promotional Broadcast Campaigns</h3>
          <p>Broadcast high-resolution catalog flyers and new arrival announcements for Deepavali, Pongal, Wedding Season, and Eid to 10,000+ customers in seconds.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Rich photo attachments & catalog flyers</li>
            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Smart audience segmentation (VIP, High-Spenders, Inactive)</li>
            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Pre-written festive Indian templates</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- 3. Billing POS & Receipts -->
        <div class="feature-card reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.2s;">
          <div class="feature-icon-bubble" style="background:var(--accent-100); color:var(--accent-600);">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-receipt"></i>
          </div>
          <h3>Paperless POS Billing & Digital Receipts</h3>
          <p>Cashier enters the customer's phone number & invoice amount. Customers immediately receive a branded digital WhatsApp invoice detailing their points earned today and total balance.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Instant digital WhatsApp receipt</li>
            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Automatic 5% loyalty points cashback</li>
            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> 1-click counter redemption discount</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- 4. Multi-Tenant -->
        <div class="feature-card reveal">
          <div class="feature-icon-bubble" style="background:#e0e7ff; color:#4338ca;">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-store"></i>
          </div>
          <h3>Multi-Store & Branch Management</h3>
          <p>Running multiple branches or outlets across cities? Manage all your stores from a unified dashboard. Every branch maintains its own isolated customer base, sender name, and billing ledger.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Separate WhatsApp numbers per branch</li>
            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Role-based cashier & store manager views</li>
            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Branch-wise revenue & points analytics</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- 5. Cloud Drive Sync -->
        <div class="feature-card reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">
          <div class="feature-icon-bubble" style="background:var(--info-bg); color:var(--info);">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-cloud-arrow-down"></i>
          </div>
          <h3>Google Drive & Sheets Auto-Sync</h3>
          <p>Staff recording entries in an Excel or Google Sheet? Simply paste your Google Sheet share link into EasyToReach to auto-fetch and continuously sync customer records without manual uploads.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Direct Google Sheets link auto-sync</li>
            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> 1-Click Excel CSV export</li>
            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Real-time cloud webhook (Shopify/Forms)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- 6. Shared Inbox & Official Meta API -->
        <div class="feature-card reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.2s;">
          <div class="feature-icon-bubble" style="background:var(--success-bg); color:var(--success);">
            <i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp"></i>
          </div>
          <h3>Official Meta Verified Sender Identity</h3>
          <p>Say goodbye to banned numbers. By integrating directly with Meta's official WhatsApp Business Cloud API, your messages arrive under your registered business name with zero risk of bans.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Store name & logo at chat top</li>
            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Meta Cloud API Tier-1 throughput</li>
            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Live WhatsApp simulator for safe trials</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

